WEBVTT

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:22.500
I rip my inescapable fate
to pieces and move forward

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:28.270
accepting the unavoidable reality in my heart

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:34.040
At the end of the sorrow and hardship

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:38.980
my writhing soul heads towards the light

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:44.820
I shout... I grant...

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:51.500
And I head past the unwavering obsessions

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:57.200
Even if just for a moment,
hold me, heart and all, in your arms

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:02.370
So I can feel the warmth of happiness

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:08.180
I destroy... I try...

00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:14.690
I just have to live with all my might

00:01:14.690 --> 00:01:20.360
I don't feel Ioneliness
since I left it somewhere

00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:25.500
Kindness... sympathy...
I don't need either of them now...

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:29.260
Shine the light!

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:40.670
Hold it!

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:42.680
Hanakuso is coming!

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:45.080
It's not Hanakuso! It's Hanagami!

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:46.710
Ouri!

00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:53.890
Yaay! You got scolded! You got scolded!

00:01:56.390 --> 00:01:58.220
I'm home!

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:03.290
"This is when both
Ouri and Makina knew nothing"

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:15.480
As if you could do it...

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:18.820
You can't do anything on your own.

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:22.810
You can't do anything right.
Not a single thing.

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:31.760
This is punishment... Your punishment
for disobeying me. Got that?

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:34.830
How long... do I have to...

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:39.630
How long? Of course, until you die.

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:42.630
Until you die, you'll be my...

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:40.330
Brother, scold them! Shouta was
scribbling on my precious T-shirt!

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:44.030
He wrote "Hanakuso" on
the back really big! I'm so pissed!

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:48.970
I can't wear it any more and I can't
go out with my friends tomorrow, either!

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:52.210
Minai Ruo...

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:52.510
"Interrogation Room 1"
Minai Ruo...

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:54.680
"Interrogation Room 1"
After stabbing her boyfriend,
who she was living with, to death,

00:03:54.680 --> 00:03:55.310
"Interrogation Room 1"
she also killed herself
by throwing herself off a building.

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:57.650
She also killed herself
by throwing herself off a building.

00:03:57.650 --> 00:04:01.240
However, even after she died,
she still stays animate.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:11.860
A corpse that moves around...

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:14.100
A Shikabane... huh?

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:17.840
There's still some time before
she becomes a complete Shikabane.

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:21.410
Keisei, you know this woman, don't you?

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:23.030
Huh?

00:04:24.170 --> 00:04:26.780
She's quite pretty...

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:28.350
Let me see...

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:32.520
She used to work at a store
in front of a train station.

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:34.890
Uhm... in other words...

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:36.350
It's a cosplay pub.

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:38.460
Cos? Oh?

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:43.790
What do people do at a place
like that? I don't know very well.

00:04:43.790 --> 00:04:47.530
Say, Kamika-san.
I don't go to places like that.

00:04:47.530 --> 00:04:47.730
"Sekuu Temple"
"Keisei Tagami"
Say, Kamika-san.
I don't go to places like that.

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:48.730
"Sekuu Temple"
"Keisei Tagami"
Ah...

00:04:49.130 --> 00:04:51.770
This was among her belongings.

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:56.740
Do you always use your business card
with your temple name in such places?

00:04:56.740 --> 00:04:58.240
You've got it all wrong, old man!

00:04:58.240 --> 00:05:01.970
It's what you'd call a social studies
field trip or something...

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:06.720
Well, but... have I met her before?

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:11.390
Anyway, no matter the circumstances,
there's a bond between you two.

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:13.090
What're you trying to say?

00:05:13.090 --> 00:05:17.560
I'm saying it's about time for you to
make a contract with a Shikabane Hime.

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:19.300
Old man...

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:23.560
There's only so much you can do to fight
Shikabane without a Shikabane Hime.

00:05:24.770 --> 00:05:26.400
Please...

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:30.500
Are you still concerned about Akasha?

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:38.150
We have no choice, then.
Let's take care of her as a regular Shikabane.

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:41.350
Kamika-san,
would you perform the prayers?

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:45.960
Hold on a sec!

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:48.950
Can't I be the one, Guardian Takamine?

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:51.160
Isaki...

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:55.970
I'm a Dai-Sozu, too. I'm qualified to make
a contract with a Shikabane Hime.

00:05:55.970 --> 00:05:59.840
I'll make a contract with this woman
and be of use to Senior Tagami.

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:02.510
Making a contract with
a Shikabane is only possible

00:06:02.510 --> 00:06:04.880
for those who have
established great virtue.

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:10.680
I do have a bond with her.
This woman talked to me in town before.

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:13.380
She wanted to... well...

00:06:13.380 --> 00:06:17.720
ask for advice about the man
she lived with, or something like that.

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:20.560
She talked to me on an impulse
due to my appearance.

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:22.630
If I remember correctly,
that's what she said.

00:06:22.630 --> 00:06:27.030
I was concerned, so I met up with
her and we talked several times since then.

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:31.560
I see. In that case, the bond is well tied.

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:32.990
Hm?!

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:38.640
We'll make a contract. Okay, Keisei?

00:06:38.640 --> 00:06:40.040
Yes.

00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:46.580
My mind is nothing like others.
My body is like a corpse.

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:49.350
Until either happiness
or death separate us,

00:06:49.350 --> 00:06:53.060
I pledge allegiance to
the decree and sectarian.

00:06:53.060 --> 00:06:54.680
Contract.

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:04.930
Wake up, Minai.

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:09.440
Breakfast... time?

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:16.070
Are you stupid?! You're dead.
What dead person would eat?!

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:19.720
Do you have any skills?

00:07:19.720 --> 00:07:23.950
Although you're stronger than humans,
if you can't make full use of weapons,

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:25.920
you won't be able to protect me.

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:28.190
Protect... you?

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:33.530
Protecting her contracted monk...
That's a Shikabane Hime's duty.

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:36.900
Uhm... I have some experience in boxing.

00:07:36.900 --> 00:07:41.540
The one called boxercising or whatever?
The one to lose weight?

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:47.480
Since I was beaten quite often, I wanted
to learn how to make it less painful.

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:51.650
No wonder you get stuck
with jerks if you're like that.

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:53.250
Okay then, show me.

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:54.480
Huh?

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:57.620
Just do it. Show me
what kind of punch you've got.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:59.610
Now, do it.

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:10.760
Y... You idiot!

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:27.280
Why are you scared now?!
Minai! Do it already!

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:29.150
But this person...

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:31.190
That's not a person. It's a corpse.

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:35.920
It's a Shikabane... one who couldn't die
when he should've, just like you.

00:08:36.630 --> 00:08:43.030
No... I don't like this...
Just me... This isn't fair!

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:48.430
Ahh... Isaki-san!

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:09.690
I almost got killed! What the hell do
I have a Shikabane Hime for?!

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:11.660
Hey! Are you listening to me?!

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:15.000
That's enough. This was her first battle.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:17.330
You can't take down Shikabane
unless you destroy their brain or

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:22.330
break their bodies into pieces so
that they can't be restored. So be careful.

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:24.740
How rude of you!

00:09:24.740 --> 00:09:26.010
You haven't been eating?

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:27.000
Well...

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:31.820
I was told that I don't need
to eat since I'm a corpse.

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:35.220
Well, it's true... that a Shikabane Hime
can survive as long as she receives

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:39.490
sufficient Rune from her contracted monk.
But you do get hungry, don't you?

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:40.390
Rune?

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:44.590
It's kind of like a bio-energy
from contracted monks.

00:09:44.590 --> 00:09:48.670
It flows into you via the bond.
You can see the bond, can't you?

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:49.500
What?

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:55.240
A Shikabane Hime sees a light flowing
towards her from her contracted monk.

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:57.230
That's the bond.

00:10:01.710 --> 00:10:05.180
It seems that this woman
doesn't understand such difficult things.

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:08.550
Seriously, she's unbelievably dimwitted.

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:15.980
"Cafe Parthenon"

00:10:17.230 --> 00:10:17.390
"Cafe Parthenon"

00:10:17.390 --> 00:10:20.030
"Cafe Parthenon"
So what're you saying is strange?

00:10:20.030 --> 00:10:22.600
"Cafe Parthenon"
Gon-Sho-Sojo Tagami says that

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:27.470
"Cafe Parthenon"
he feels no bond between
Dai-Sozu Isaki and his Shikabane Hime.

00:10:27.470 --> 00:10:27.540
"Cafe Parthenon"
No bond? But they made a contract, right?

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:31.410
No bond? But they made a contract, right?

00:10:31.410 --> 00:10:33.910
That's because we believed what Isaki said.

00:10:33.910 --> 00:10:38.380
But he said that the Shikabane Hime
didn't seem to be receiving Rune.

00:10:38.380 --> 00:10:42.220
Then... what's that mean?

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:44.920
That is, she isn't a Shikabane Hime and

00:10:44.920 --> 00:10:48.930
a Shikabane that happens
to be harmless is by his side. That's all.

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:51.500
You never know when she'll become
violent and start going on a rampage.

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:55.430
I thought that you two
might be able to check it out.

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:59.270
Yeah. Our target isn't Shikabane.

00:10:59.270 --> 00:11:02.510
It's humans and Shikabane Hime, so...

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:07.240
Good grief... we just got in this town and...

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:12.680
A motorcycle?

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:16.650
Yes. I had a motorcycle license, so...

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:20.460
If I have a motorcycle,
I think less Shikabane will get away.

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:24.530
So you want me to buy a motorcycle
for you? Are you stupid?

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:27.330
I can't spend that kind of
money on a Shikabane Hime.

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:30.830
Meals? A motorcycle? Don't get cocky.

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:31.820
But...

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:34.460
What?

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:37.530
It might be... a Shikabane.

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:40.640
Hey, you!

00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:42.640
It's a Shikabane!

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:53.790
Go, Minai! Go after it!

00:12:12.010 --> 00:12:13.010
I knew it.

00:12:13.010 --> 00:12:14.640
Shikabane!

00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:22.020
I am a Shikabane Hime.

00:12:22.020 --> 00:12:23.050
What?

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:24.680
Look.

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:33.860
My contracted monk is near here.

00:12:33.860 --> 00:12:39.740
With the Rune I received from him,
this kind of scratch can be gone right away.

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:44.610
But what about you? You were right
next to your contracted monk earlier.

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:47.710
But your injury didn't heal...

00:12:47.710 --> 00:12:49.710
There's no Shikabane Hime like that.

00:12:49.710 --> 00:12:52.250
What on earth...

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:55.690
There's no bond
between you and that monk.

00:12:55.690 --> 00:13:00.920
As it stands, you're just a Shikabane.
You'll start going on a rampage soon.

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:03.090
Before that happens...

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:06.430
So this is... punishment, too.

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:08.930
Where are you, Minai?! Dammit!

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:11.420
Isaki-san! Don't come this way!

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:29.590
Hey, what happened to the Shikabane?

00:13:29.590 --> 00:13:31.420
It got away.

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:38.330
What's the matter?

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:41.300
Hold off on their punishment for a bit.

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:42.500
Huh?

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:44.800
Something... concerns me.

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:02.450
Why didn't you tell me
something so important?!

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:03.750
But...

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:06.860
So she said she was a Shikabane Hime?

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:11.030
Yes. And she said it was strange
that my injury didn't heal.

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:13.930
That's just because you're a dimwit.

00:14:13.930 --> 00:14:14.860
You believed her?

00:14:14.860 --> 00:14:15.850
Yes...

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:19.270
No... but...

00:14:19.270 --> 00:14:21.640
A Shikabane Hime...

00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:23.630
Could it be...

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:27.480
In any case, everything she said was a lie.

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:29.350
Uhm, Isaki-san...

00:14:29.350 --> 00:14:29.980
Hm?

00:14:29.980 --> 00:14:33.520
You know me, right?

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:39.160
I asked you for advice
on the street. When was that?

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:43.060
You, too, doubt the contract
between you and me?

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:49.400
It's a lie.

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:53.560
But if the Guardian hears a lie like that...

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:55.740
What will happen?

00:14:55.740 --> 00:15:00.680
You and I... will get separated.

00:15:00.680 --> 00:15:04.380
Before that happens...
give me your hand, Minai.

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:07.550
I need you.

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:08.980
Me?

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:26.540
"Okonomiyaki"

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:27.870
"Due to personal reasons, we've closed our
business. Thank you very much for your
patronage over the years.
Restaurant Owner"

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:32.240
What're you doing, Sadahiro?

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:38.380
You... Did you follow me?
Is that how little trust you have in me?

00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:40.020
Who said that?

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:45.090
You'll investigate Isaki
and I'll investigate Minai, right?

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:46.590
Don't get them mixed up.

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:47.690
If you'd listen...

00:15:47.690 --> 00:15:50.890
- In this town, Minai used to...
- In this place, Isaki used to...

00:15:50.890 --> 00:15:52.520
What?

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:55.420
"Okonomiyaki"

00:15:56.130 --> 00:16:00.540
To be honest, there's a Shikabane
that I've had my eye on all this time.

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:05.940
Of all others, he's pretending to be
the chief monk at a Kougon Sect temple.

00:16:09.380 --> 00:16:13.720
The Kougon Sect is afraid
of scandals so they're leaving him alone.

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:18.980
But I can't allow it.
So we'll take care of it on our own.

00:16:20.260 --> 00:16:22.920
There. He's in the back there.

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:29.270
He's not here.

00:16:29.270 --> 00:16:30.890
What?!

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:37.240
Shikabane?!

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:39.900
You're... Shuuji!

00:16:40.280 --> 00:16:45.270
Shuuji! What're you doing here?!
What're you trying to do?!

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:47.410
B... Brother...

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:57.660
Just as you saw.
That is my family's home.

00:16:57.660 --> 00:16:59.800
That was my older brother.

00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:04.430
I tried to have you kill my own brother.

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:11.360
My older brother is... scum.

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:15.980
All he ever thought about
was asking our old man for money.

00:17:15.980 --> 00:17:21.950
How he'd make money... That's all
he talked about from his childhood.

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:23.820
Although he was like that,

00:17:23.820 --> 00:17:28.630
my parents had decided from
the start that he was the successor.

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:31.800
Our old man died and my
brother inherited the temple.

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:37.460
Soon after, he wasted the inheritance
to build that stupid main hall.

00:17:38.300 --> 00:17:41.870
And... in order for me to become one of
the Kougon Sect's contracted monks,

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:44.140
which are its backstage people,

00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:46.870
I was forced to join that side of the Sect.

00:17:47.240 --> 00:17:50.580
But he's your older brother, right?

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:53.520
I thought it wouldn't be
a problem if I had you kill him

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:57.750
and then reported that he
had actually become a Shikabane.

00:17:57.750 --> 00:17:59.090
What?

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:03.890
You knew, didn't you?
There's no bond between you and me.

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:07.390
I didn't know you before you
became a Shikabane.

00:18:08.570 --> 00:18:12.570
But I needed a Shikabane Hime.

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:16.940
Once I became a contracted monk,
I'd take down Shikabane one after another.

00:18:16.940 --> 00:18:20.380
I'd surpass Keisei Tagami and get promoted.

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:25.220
I'd become at least Gon-Dai-Sojo
and look down upon my brother.

00:18:25.220 --> 00:18:32.690
I had to do it... But now my
superiors are suspicious of you.

00:18:32.690 --> 00:18:36.790
If I lose you, I won't be able
to rise for the rest of my life.

00:18:36.790 --> 00:18:42.860
So... I thought at least if you had killed
my brother while you're still around...

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:49.740
How long are you going to
be standing there? Just go already.

00:18:49.740 --> 00:18:50.970
But...

00:18:50.970 --> 00:18:55.650
You aren't my Shikabane Hime.
You're just a Shikabane.

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:57.650
You don't need Rune.

00:18:57.650 --> 00:19:01.720
Follow your regrets
and go anywhere you want.

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:02.790
Do as you please.

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:03.750
But...

00:19:03.750 --> 00:19:05.050
What?

00:19:05.050 --> 00:19:08.730
I'm still in the middle of being punished.

00:19:08.730 --> 00:19:10.490
Being punished... you said?

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:15.130
I'm a murderer. I'm a sinner.
The punishment for that...

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:18.120
Are you saying that being
with me is your punishment?!

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:22.570
What?

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:23.740
I can see it.

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:24.940
See what?

00:19:24.940 --> 00:19:28.600
I can see your face... clearly.

00:19:29.010 --> 00:19:34.750
Though it's so dark,
you look to me as if you're shining.

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:36.950
